[t8] Operations Lead: I'll make sure the communication to the DBA team is clear on that. Also, I'll assign our colleague, Alex, to help coordinate with the DBA team and get an update on when they'll have their findings, so we can plan the restart and API failover accordingly.

[t9] Safety Auditor: That's a good plan, and I'll add Alex to the team's communication loop too. We should also make sure that Alex is aware of the plan and timeline, so they can keep us updated and make sure we're aligned on any changes to the investigation or proposed fixes.

